  "title": "Yellowed Smoky Saudi Arabian Feta Kebabs",
  "description": "Savory and springy kebabs featuring feta, binchotan-charcoal, and traditional Saudi Arabian flavors, perfect for adventurous eaters, this dish is onion and garlic free. The smoky flavor from the binchotan-charcoal adds a unique twist to the traditional kebabs.",
