      "amount": "1/2 teaspoon"
    },
    {
      "name": "black pepper",
      "amount": "1/4 teaspoon"
    },
    {
      "name": "cherry tomatoes",
      "amount": "1 cup",
      "notes": "halved"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the grill to medium-high heat.",
    "Thread cherry tomatoes onto skewers.",
    "Crumble feta cheese into a bowl and mix with zaatar, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Brush pita bread slices with olive oil and grill for 2 minutes per side.",
    "Place the skewers on the grill and cook for 5 minutes per side.",
    "Smoke the kebabs using binchotan charcoal for 2 minutes.",
    "Serve the kebabs on top of the grilled pita bread with a squeeze of lemon juice.",
    "Garnish with additional zaatar and cherry tomatoes if desired."
